# A TEST MODEL FOR EIGEN SOLVER WITH CONSTRAINTS IMPLEMENTED BY MULTIPLIERS
# two cantilevers with stiffness 300 and 900 carry masses of 10 each
# they vibrate at 30 and 90 independently, and at (300 + 900) / (10 + 10) = 60 when tied

node 1 0 0
node 2 0 1
node 3 1 0
node 4 1 1

material Elastic1D 1 100 0

element EB21 1 1 2 10 1 1 0
element EB21 3 3 4 10 3 1 0

mass 2 2 10 1
mass 4 4 10 1

fix 1 E 1 3

# tie horizontal displacements of both tips
mpc 2 0 0 2 1 1 4 1 -1

step frequency 1 1
set band_mat 0

analyze

# Eigenvalues:
# 60.0000
peek eigenvalue

exit
